Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.24,Hook,,0,0,0,,¡ES ALÉRGICO A TODO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ah, pero es alérgico a\Ntodo, el gordo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:07.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Sí, cierto! Comida no,\Ndice mi mamá.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:08.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Cordero, cordero,\Ncordero!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Pobrecito, está buenísimo\Nel cordero!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Esto qué es?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Chicken! No, chicken no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Puro salmón y res,\N¿verdad, mami?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:20.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Pobrecito!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No, dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:23.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Es un «no» rotundo, eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:27.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Y qué? ¿Tiene energía? Ya\Nnada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:29.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ah, ok! Que ya nada de\Naquí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.94,0:00:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Puro juguete! Puro\Njuguete, y ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ahí, ni modo, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:40.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Quién te manda a ser\Nalérgico, wey?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Muy delicado!
